    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Adds an &#8220;Edit Alternate Content&#8221; button beside Add Media. The alternate version is stored in post meta, so the original post content is never replaced. Choose per post whether visitors see the alternate or original content.</p>\n<p>Settings are under Settings &gt; AltEdit Content Switcher.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the <code>altedit-content-switcher</code> folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code>.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin.</li>\n<li>Configure it under Settings &gt; AltEdit Content Switcher.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "AltEdit Content Switcher adds an alternate Classic Editor to posts and pages, stored separately from the original content.",
